L0FFA MsgDexterityDots ; bootup ; "Dexterity......."
L100B MsgIntelligenceDots ; bootup ; "Intelligence...."
L101C MsgWisdomDots ; bootup ; "Wisdom.........."
L102D MsgOK ; bootup ; "O.K.?"
L1045 SexKeys ; bootup ; "MFO"
L106B RaceKeys ; bootup ; "HEDBF"
