L10FE MsgLookTitle ; bootup ; "Look at a Character" (title of LookAtChar)
L1112 MsgStatusColon ; bootup ; "Status:"
L111A MsgWeaponColon ; bootup ; "Weapon:"
L1122 MsgArmourColon ; bootup ; "Armour:"
