L11E7 MsgDispersed ; bootup ; "(Dispersed!)"
L11F4 MsgDisperseTitle ; bootup ; "Disperse the Party" (title of DisperseParty)
L1207 CritErrRetry ; bootup ; int 24h handler: AL = 1 (retry), then the iret at 1209 (TITLE)
L120A StartUp ; bootup ; entry (from the jmp at 0100): load the files, draw the title, run TitleLoop
L132B DrawMenuFrame ; bootup ; frame of the menu area (text rows 10-23); DX = screen offset of its bottom line
L1385 ClearMenu ; bootup ; clear the inside of the frame (BIOS scroll, rows 0Bh-16h, columns 1-26h)
L14C9 RunOrganizeMenu ; bootup ; the "Party Organization" menu until M, Q or Esc
L194B ExamineRegister ; bootup ; list the 20 roster slots
L19DB TerminateChar ; bootup ; "Terminate!": erase a roster slot (not one in the party)
L1A6D CreateChar ; bootup ; "Create": enter a new character into an empty roster slot
L1CE7 WaitSpace ; bootup ; print "Press <Space>" and wait for the space bar
L1D07 PartyToRoster ; bootup ; copy the party's records back into their roster slots
L1D34 RosterToParty ; bootup ; copy the members' roster records into PartyChars
L1D61 RosterRecord ; bootup ; BX = address of roster record number BL (1-20)
L1D71 AnimateDemo ; bootup ; animate the tile graphics and redraw the DEMO.ULT block
L1DA8 AnyAlive ; bootup ; AH = 0FFh if one of the four PartyChars is G or P, else 0
L1DC6 AskScenarioDisk ; bootup ; disabled: a ret patched over its first byte; the rest (1DC7-1E0B) is dead
L1E0C AskNumber ; bootup ; read a two-digit number at the cursor, retry on error; AL = BCD, AH = binary
